{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-8","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与平行线与角","englishTitle":"If two straight lines be parallel, and one of them be at right angles to any plane, the remaining one will also be at right angles to the same plane.","book":11,"number":8,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":8,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","contentId":"euclid-11-8","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcde86d3ca3c7df56ac27e24c5f99a8e55c2d7ab11adb5e7ebb8b02dd9475852","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-8.statement","euclid-11-8.construction.1","euclid-11-8.construction.2","euclid-11-8.construction.3","euclid-11-8.proof.1","euclid-11-8.proof.2","euclid-11-8.proof.3","euclid-11-8.proof.4","euclid-11-8.proof.5","euclid-11-8.proof.6","euclid-11-8.proof.7","euclid-11-8.proof.8","euclid-11-8.proof.9","euclid-11-8.proof.10","euclid-11-8.proof.11","euclid-11-8.proof.12","euclid-11-8.proof.13","euclid-11-8.conclusion","euclid-11-8.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-8.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d79ebbf01dfb543501f5ef9547b6c8bbc244d2b2fae5ed8c7db82c1ed6345e2b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines be parallel, and one of them be at right angles to any plane, the remaining one will also be at right angles to the same plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线平行,其中一条线为直角至平面,其余一条线也将为直角至平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1838f8861213c06cf82a6111cab6c5da0b399ae4007836d52ffcedae4d47e40b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be two parallel straight lines, and let one of them, AB, be at right angles to the plane of reference; I say that the remaining one, CD, will also be at right angles to the same plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD线平行,让其中一条线,即AB线在直角到平面参考线之间;我说,剩下的一条,即CD线也将在直角到平面相同的平面线上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93fcf0ae266264085a4dde446ccadfbf680502d1864dfd140d50add8e2d441a7","citations":["euclid-11-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB, CD meet the plane of reference at the points B, D, and let BD be joined; therefore AB, CD, BD are in one plane. [[XI. 7](/principles/euclid-11-7)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,CD连接到B,D点的平面参考线,BD连接到BD,因此AB,CD,BD位于平面。 [[XI. 7](/principles/euclid-11-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"adf50a8e18d045c592d10af17d6e09e125d7789f90e5ad688836e9567d5e0583","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DE be drawn, in the plane of reference, at right angles to BD, let DE be made equal to AB, and let BE, AE, AD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在参考文件平面中,请将DE幅划为直角至BD,将DE幅划为AB,将BE、AE、AD幅划为BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e83051f0d616d1db03dc67977208e5bf4c763d82e347a13b757588139cc02717","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is at right angles to the plane of reference, therefore AB is also at right angles to all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference; [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] therefore each of the angles ABD, ABE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB是直角, 参考值为平面, 因此AB也是直角, 相交的直线, 并且在平面 参考值中, 因此每个角度 ABD, ABE 是正确的 。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1178c38d4299f3937f76595762fe3b13d6d1de22dc44f22c9e8876a064057ea","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line BD has fallen on the parallels AB, CD, therefore the angles ABD, CDB are equal to two right angles. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD直线已经下降至AB,CD,ABD角度等于2 直角（相关点与线段：CDB） [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2218b51c712ac65844c088cd486e87689881775e23e73b9bd0f1297ea73a754","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABD is right; therefore the angle CDB is also right; therefore CD is at right angles to BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABD该角是直角,因此CDB角度也是正确的,因此CD角度为直角至BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4514d271d0728a4e5c042f7fa06893e2491223a3e59be915c59c6786c7ea134d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is equal to DE, and BD is common, the two sides AB, BD are equal to the two sides ED, DB; and the angle ABD is equal to the angle EDB, for each is right; therefore the base AD is equal to the base BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB等于DE,BD是共同的,双方AB,BD等于ED,DB;ABD的角等于EDB,因为每个角为直角;因此,底边,AD等于底边,BE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d7d624fe6189b0df05d75b318a954ed06976ebce62d95c19142212303a0d525f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is equal to DE, and BE to AD, the two sides AB, BE are equal to the two sides ED, DA respectively, and AE is their common base; therefore the angle ABE is equal to the angle EDA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB等于DE,BE至AD,双方AB、BE等于双方ED、DA,AE是双方的共同底边;因此,角度ABE等于角度EDA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"009095dfdd2330810090fb082ebec8e125d47640192412f9b800e06f01769583","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABE is right; therefore the angle EDA is also right; therefore ED is at right angles to AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABE该角是直角,因此EDA角度也是正确的,因此ED角度为直角至AD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c0a379ce43b9e40d9b58cbeb4870f5cb6a848e2854f5632add9367be62a72aa","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also at right angles to DB; therefore ED is also at right angles to the plane through BD, DA. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也为直角至DB;因此,ED也是直角至平面至BD,DA。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18eb0275c3e5f73df09e3bfa711d3f4b8a733360364694f78b96dfb8c5209d34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ED will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane through BD, DA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ED也将会达到直角个, 加上所有连接的直线, 位于平面到BD, DA之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a8891837228b0faf20de25644264e8e02ab9b0a817e87618e7cd506ca18e0fd","citations":["euclid-11-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DC is in the plane through BD, DA, inasmuch as AB, BD are in the plane through BD, DA, [[XI. 2](/principles/euclid-11-2)] and DC is also in the plane in which AB, BD are."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DC属于平面至BD,DA属于AB,BD属于平面至BD,DC属于平面至BD。 [[XI. 2](/principles/euclid-11-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f986597415b317fb6567210596e27d3974a34b10b83162e84f4e143e44f9dc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ED is at right angles to DC, so that CD is also at right angles to DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ED为直角至DC,CD也是直角至DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0b6ab55eae71e03a02afc491d41aee6e2bb83ce31da2f6606b7770de1345dad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD is also at right angles to BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CD也是直角到BD"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fcd211dcee50bcec33bedfd333a1fac2d217264e85b18f1186902fbeac83c446","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is set up at right angles to the two straight lines DE, DB which cut one another, from the point of section at D; so that CD is also at right angles to the plane through DE, DB. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD线设于直角至DE,DB直线之间,从D段点相互分隔;因此,CD线也设于直角至平面至DE线,DB直线相距DE。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"256a4d1325ead46261267d1116fce3c8fdc4c7fec4fb624d508a37fbf8cfca20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the plane through DE, DB is the plane of reference; therefore CD is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平面至DE,DB是平面参考;因此,CD是直角至平面参考。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":17,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-8.source","contentId":"euclid-11-8","revisionId":"euclid-11-8@raw-bcde86d3ca3c7df5","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0975dfbb3794e0452dc8683b28c28abc7ce933f59ff6849256be2ae6e5780142","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-8:euclid-11-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-8.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. 7"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-8:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-8.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-8:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-8.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-8:euclid-11-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-8.proof.7","euclid-11-8.proof.12"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-4","type"